                                "sense_id": "153fa2bc-aa3e-3998-b746-59b3834f33ab",
                                "text": "It is a remarkable fact that the most fresh steenstrupine in lujavrites and veins is found in rocks carrying albite (and ussingite)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6f3413e-6822-40e8-83ec-39ee75c5ba4d",
                                "sense_id": "153fa2bc-aa3e-3998-b746-59b3834f33ab",
                                "text": "In most of the Ilímaussaq rocks, Th and U are concentrated in eudialyte, but in the final lujavrites they are largely held by steenstrupine."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
